					<h2><a href="index.html?p=1144" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Musawwir Gowins">Musawwir Gowins</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Jul 10th, 2014 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
					<p class="post-meta"><ul class='post-meta'>
